WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:03.203
Roxy looked at the city streets below.

2
00:00:03.204 --> 00:00:08.114
She saw lines of robots moving about like ants in a colony.

3
00:00:08.115 --> 00:00:12.375
Cozlin bit her lip. Roxy could tell she was scared.

4
00:00:12.376 --> 00:00:15.818
"This is fine!" Cozlin said suddenly.

5
00:00:15.819 --> 00:00:19.343
"We can definitely handle it."

6
00:00:19.344 --> 00:00:25.069
She flew the spaceship close to a large building covered in robots, and gulped.

7
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:29.166
"What is that place?" Roxy asked.

8
00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:34.768
"King Radnik's palace." Cozlin picked up a communication device.

9
00:00:34.769 --> 00:00:39.348
"This is Kid Comet! I'm trying to reach King Radnik."

10
00:00:39.349 --> 00:00:41.118
There was no answer.

11
00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:43.734
"Uh-oh," Roxy thought.

12
00:00:43.735 --> 00:00:46.942
Finally a voice came through the communication device.

13
00:00:46.943 --> 00:00:52.339
"King Radnik is in an underground bunker. I'll send you the location."

14
00:00:52.340 --> 00:01:01.856
Cozlin let out a huge sigh of relief.

15
00:01:01.857 --> 00:01:06.837
Soon the spaceship arrived at two large metal doors in the side of a grassy hill.

16
00:01:06.838 --> 00:01:11.773
The doors opened, and the spaceship flew in.

17
00:01:11.774 --> 00:01:15.677
"I'm glad you're back, Kid Comet!" King Radnik said.

18
00:01:15.678 --> 00:01:19.072
He looked at Roxy. "Thank you for coming.

19
00:01:19.073 --> 00:01:23.196
Those robots are causing a lot of trouble."

20
00:01:23.197 --> 00:01:29.667
"I'm happy to help, King, um, Your Majesty," Roxy said.

21
00:01:29.668 --> 00:01:33.771
They went into a meeting room where a screen displayed a map of the capital.

22
00:01:33.772 --> 00:01:37.325
Government officials hurried back and forth.

23
00:01:37.326 --> 00:01:40.863
"We're planning an evacuation," King Radnik said.

24
00:01:40.864 --> 00:01:44.420
"I want every Delkorian off the planet as fast as possible.

25
00:01:44.421 --> 00:01:48.147
And I want to know where those robots came from.

26
00:01:48.148 --> 00:01:51.562
Who sent them? Why are they here?"

27
00:01:51.563 --> 00:01:55.192
Cozlin nodded. "I'll figure it out!"

28
00:01:55.193 --> 00:01:58.128
"We both will," Roxy said.

29
00:01:58.129 --> 00:02:06.159
Cozlin glanced at her. "Right! We both will."

30
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:11.355
*** Cozlin landed her spaceship just outside the

31
00:02:11.356 --> 00:02:14.370
city. Roxy watched the robots move around the streets.

32
00:02:14.371 --> 00:02:18.220
Every robot had the letter M stamped on it.

33
00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:23.267
"I wonder what that M stands for," Roxy said.

34
00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:30.033
"Who cares," Cozlin said. Zap! She blasted a robot.

35
00:02:30.034 --> 00:02:35.345
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blew apart another robot.

36
00:02:35.346 --> 00:02:42.009
One robot pointed at Roxy and Cozlin. "Destroy them!"

37
00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:45.822
Robots stomped toward the two superheroes.

38
00:02:45.823 --> 00:02:50.202
"Uh-oh!" Roxy flew fast.

39
00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:54.770
She darted away from one robot and smashed another.

40
00:02:54.771 --> 00:03:00.893
Cozlin zipped back and forth, blasting robots that tried to grab her.

41
00:03:00.894 --> 00:03:04.812
As Roxy flew, she saw a robot chomping on a vehicle.

42
00:03:04.813 --> 00:03:12.109
The robot hummed and then another robot popped out of its back.

43
00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:16.630
Whiz-hoo! She blasted the first robot, and it blew up.

44
00:03:16.631 --> 00:03:22.630
Then Roxy gasped. The second robot fell over, lifeless.

45
00:03:22.631 --> 00:03:27.147
Cozlin saw it too. "Rocket Girl!" she said.

46
00:03:27.148 --> 00:03:30.162
"We need to destroy the first robot that came here!

47
00:03:30.163 --> 00:03:36.417
Then maybe all the others will stop working!"

48
00:03:36.418 --> 00:03:39.489
The two of them blasted one robot after another.

49
00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:44.307
But it didn't seem to help. Robots were still everywhere!

50
00:03:44.308 --> 00:03:48.839
Roxy and Cozlin were exhausted.

51
00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:53.904
They flew out of the city and flopped on the ground.

52
00:03:53.905 --> 00:03:59.785
"This is awful!" Cozlin said. "What am I going to do?"

53
00:03:59.786 --> 00:04:04.620
"You mean, what are we going to do," Roxy said.

54
00:04:04.621 --> 00:04:08.226
"Don't forget—you dragged me into this.

55
00:04:08.227 --> 00:04:13.160
You said it would just take an hour or two!"

56
00:04:13.161 --> 00:04:17.854
Cozlin sat up suddenly. "Did you hear that?"

57
00:04:17.855 --> 00:04:20.920
Roxy scratched her head. "Huh?"

58
00:04:20.921 --> 00:04:24.224
"Someone's here," Cozlin said.

59
00:04:24.225 --> 00:04:27.730
Roxy saw an alien peeking over a nearby boulder.

60
00:04:27.731 --> 00:04:35.945
He gasped, ran to a scooter, and zoomed away.

